WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Ryu falls from the prerequisite Sprint slide.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.850
The first forward dash advances during knockdown.

3
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.350
The second dash closes the throw distance.

4
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.800
Kimberly delays the normal throw until Ryu is standing.

5
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.150
The throw knocks Ryu down again.
